{"id":"5957","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5957_main_stratus-fractus-of-wet-weather_clouds.png","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>广大而厚重的浅灰色雨层云衬托出潮湿天气<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">碎层云</span>的不规则和破碎的碎片。在有些地方有潮湿天气的碎积云块，其特征是<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">独特的水平云底</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">更大的垂直厚度</span>。</p>\n<p>小雨持续了9个小时。一个小时后，随着雨层云底抬升并向东退去，降雨停止。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Michael Bruhn","location":"澳大利亚，蒙通VIC 3194","latitude":"纬度: 37° 58' 56'' S","longitude":"经度: 145° 4' 15'' E","date":"20 June 2016 1238 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西","cloudCode":"CL= 7, CM= 2, CH= /","code":"图像P/S代码: P.8.8","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.8.8"},{"src":"/images/original/syn/5957_syn_stratus-fractus-of-wet-weather_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>东边的低压系统在加深并向南东南方向移动。该低压系统正在支配着澳大利亚维多利亚州中南部上空潮湿的向岸南东南偏东风。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 澳大利亚联邦2016，澳大利亚气象局","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/original/upper/5957_upper_stratus-fractus-of-wet-weather_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>从地面到850 hPa饱和，从850 hPa到236 hPa 的对流层顶非常湿润</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 怀俄明大学","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/sat/5957_sat_stratus-fractus-of-wet-weather_clouds.jpeg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"><p>葵花-8卫星13号通道红外图像显示出大片云带环绕着澳大利亚维多利亚东海岸海面的低压系统。墨尔本几乎是在消散云带的西缘。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 澳大利亚联邦2016，澳大利亚气象局/日本气象厅","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]},{"type":"pri","label":"1987年版图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4553_main_stratus-fractus-and-cumulus-fractus-pannus-of-bad-weather-below-altostratus-opacus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc5\"><p>暗灰色、破碎的低云层（层云碎块，即雨层云云片）可见 <span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">位于1处</span>，上方是厚重的高层云云层。</p>\n<p>在 <span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">2</span>、<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">3</span>、<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">4</span> <span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">和5处</span> 有一些圆润且颜色更深的积云碎块（恶劣天气的雨层云云片）。</p>\n<p>一个强低压系统已在爱尔兰以西发展，此时位于</p>\n<p>英吉利海峡的西部入口区域。暖锋位于该区域西南方约150公里处，带来大范围云层和降水。</p></div>","copyright":"© R.K. Pilsbury","location":"Totland, Isle of Wight, United Kingdom of Great Britain and Northern Ireland","latitude":"纬度: 50° 40' 18'' N","longitude":"经度: 1° 32' 51'' W","date":"13 September 1975 1530 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西南","cloudCode":"CL= 7, CM= 2, CH= /","code":"","imageId":""}]}]}